# L §6.1 Consolidation: "an internal leg with no written link is listed and makes the group total a hole naming it"
# (C-14); L §8.1 HOLE-SAME "<movement> crosses to <member> with no link". As L6_1_consolidation_linked, without the
# same line linking a.gift to b.gift_in_m: a.gift's leg into b.konto (through a.to_ben, stated same) is unlinked, so
# b.konto's balance and the total over accounts are holes naming it; a.konto's own leg is booked (12 200.00 PLN).
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0b0615a67a4ae71646df39a5edbd8b0a4fe46b72c4f53654cfa7eaa10b6a9a81"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "4f927bb0b7b8b6a1acfc3c6b41ae7af8e9f8b78b4e5a331024f351ac66548a01"
  same a.to_ben = b.konto

ask t: sum(bal(p, 2026-12-31) for p in accounts on 2026-12-31)
ask ka: bal(a.konto, 2026-12-31)
ask kb: bal(b.konto, 2026-12-31)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place to_ben: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input pay_dom: int
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from konto to to_ben amount gift_amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  wage_amt = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa"
  gift_amt = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place from_ana: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_in: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move gift_in_m: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from from_ana to konto amount gift_in

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  gift_in = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 200.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== expect t ka kb
t: ?"a.gift crosses to b with no link" (a.gift)
  cut 2026-01-05
ka: 12 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
kb: ?"a.gift crosses to b with no link" (a.gift)
  cut 2026-01-05
